{
  "name": "W08 · Nazar clip review queue (two raters, our page resumes the Wait node)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "md/clip-ready",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c8a00008-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Clip ready for review (from Workflows)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "0f6b1c3a-8a7e-4d6f-9b2e-c8a000080001",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ON_IMPORT",
          "name": "MD inbound webhook token"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Called by the Render Workflows task `clip_ingest` after transcode → blur faces/plates → proposeWindows (Gemini, offline, M-06). Signed envelope (no raw-body handling needed in n8n): body = { ts, payload: '<JSON string>', sig: 'sha256=<hex HMAC of ts.payload>' }. payload = { clip_id, proposed_windows_count, blur_audit_url }."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "action": "hmac",
        "type": "SHA256",
        "value": "={{ $json.body.ts }}.{{ $json.body.payload }}",
        "dataPropertyName": "expected_signature",
        "secret": "={{ $vars.MD_HMAC_SECRET }}",
        "encoding": "hex"
      },
      "id": "c8a00008-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Compute expected HMAC",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.crypto",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c-sig",
              "leftValue": "={{ 'sha256=' + $json.expected_signature === $json.body.sig && Math.abs(Date.now()/1000 - Number($json.body.ts)) < 300 }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c8a00008-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Signature valid + fresh?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { accepted: true, execution_id: $execution.id } }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 202
        }
      },
      "id": "c8a00008-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "202 Accepted",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        660,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { accepted: false, reason: 'bad_signature' } }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 401
        }
      },
      "id": "c8a00008-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "401 Bad signature",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        660,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $vars.MD_API_BASE }}/v1/admin/clips/{{ $('Parse payload').item.json.clip_id }}/review-tasks",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $vars.MD_N8N_READ_TOKEN }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ stage: 'rater_1', resume_url: $execution.resumeUrl, n8n_execution_id: $execution.id, due_in_hours: 48 }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 20000
        }
      },
      "id": "c8a00008-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "API-55 create rater-1 task (with resume URL)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        220
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "notes": "Backend stores resume_url on the E-21 ClipRating task (never shown to the browser). The curator page /admin/clips/{id} lets rater 1 scrub frames, set hazard onset/offset windows and confirm the blur audit. On save, the BACKEND POSTs { stage, rater_id, decision, windows_hash } to resume_url with the resume header token."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $vars.MD_CURATOR_TELEGRAM_CHAT }}",
        "text": "=🎬 Clip {{ $('Parse payload').item.json.clip_id }} is ready for rater 1. {{ $('Parse payload').item.json.proposed_windows_count }} AI-proposed windows (proposals only). Open: {{ $vars.MD_CONSOLE_BASE }}/admin/clips/{{ $('Parse payload').item.json.clip_id }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "disable_notification": false
        }
      },
      "id": "c8a00008-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Notify curators (rater 1)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        220
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ON_IMPORT",
          "name": "Margdarshak curators bot"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "notes": "Notification only. The approval itself is NOT a Telegram send-and-wait (reports of non-resuming send-and-wait on Telegram/Gmail: n8n issue #13331). Approval = our page → backend → Wait-node resume webhook."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resume": "webhook",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "limitWaitTime": true,
        "limitType": "afterTimeInterval",
        "resumeAmount": 48,
        "resumeUnit": "hours",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c8a00008-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "Wait for rater 1 (≤ 48 h)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1320,
        220
      ],
      "webhookId": "9d3e5a10-1b2c-4d3e-8f40-c8a000080008",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ON_IMPORT",
          "name": "MD resume token"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "typeValidation": "loose",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.body?.decision }}",
                    "rightValue": "windows_set",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "windows_set"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "typeValidation": "loose",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.body?.decision }}",
                    "rightValue": "reject",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "reject"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra",
          "renameFallbackOutput": "timeout"
        }
      },
      "id": "c8a00008-0000-4000-8000-000000000009",
      "name": "Rater 1 decision",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        1540,
        220
      ],
      "notes": "Timeout = the Wait node resumed by its time limit with no body."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $vars.MD_API_BASE }}/v1/admin/clips/{{ $('Parse payload').item.json.clip_id }}/review-tasks",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $vars.MD_N8N_READ_TOKEN }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ stage: 'rater_2', resume_url: $execution.resumeUrl, n8n_execution_id: $execution.id, exclude_rater_id: $json.body.rater_id, blind_to_rater_1: true, due_in_hours: 48 }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 20000
        }
      },
      "id": "c8a00008-0000-4000-8000-00000000000a",
      "name": "API-55 create rater-2 task (blind)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1760,
        120
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "notes": "Rater 2 must be a different person and does not see rater 1's windows (independent ratings → honest agreement score, D-22)."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $vars.MD_CURATOR_TELEGRAM_CHAT }}",
        "text": "=🎬 Clip {{ $('Parse payload').item.json.clip_id }} needs a second, independent rater. Open: {{ $vars.MD_CONSOLE_BASE }}/admin/clips/{{ $('Parse payload').item.json.clip_id }}?stage=rater_2",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "c8a00008-0000-4000-8000-00000000000b",
      "name": "Notify curators (rater 2)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1980,
        120
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ON_IMPORT",
          "name": "Margdarshak curators bot"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resume": "webhook",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "limitWaitTime": true,
        "limitType": "afterTimeInterval",
        "resumeAmount": 48,
        "resumeUnit": "hours",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c8a00008-0000-4000-8000-00000000000c",
      "name": "Wait for rater 2 (≤ 48 h)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        2200,
        120
      ],
      "webhookId": "9d3e5a10-1b2c-4d3e-8f40-c8a00008000c",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ON_IMPORT",
          "name": "MD resume token"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c-r2",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body?.decision }}",
              "rightValue": "windows_set",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c8a00008-0000-4000-8000-00000000000d",
      "name": "Rater 2 set windows?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        2420,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $vars.MD_API_BASE }}/v1/admin/clips/{{ $('Parse payload').item.json.clip_id }}/finalize",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $vars.MD_N8N_READ_TOKEN }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Idempotency-Key",
              "value": "=clip-finalize:{{ $('Parse payload').item.json.clip_id }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ n8n_execution_id: $execution.id }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 20000
        }
      },
      "id": "c8a00008-0000-4000-8000-00000000000e",
      "name": "API-55 finalize → Workflows clip_finalize",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        2640,
        40
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "notes": "Backend starts the Render Workflows task `clip_finalize`: computeAgreement (Cohen's κ / onset Δ in code) → if agreement ≥ threshold: publish to R2 public bucket + manifest + CDN warm; else back to adjudication. AI never auto-publishes."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $vars.MD_CURATOR_TELEGRAM_CHAT }}",
        "text": "=✅ Clip {{ $('Parse payload').item.json.clip_id }}: both raters done. Agreement + publish running as a Workflows run ({{ $json.task_run_id }}).",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "c8a00008-0000-4000-8000-00000000000f",
      "name": "Notify: finalizing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        2860,
        40
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ON_IMPORT",
          "name": "Margdarshak curators bot"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $vars.MD_API_BASE }}/v1/admin/clips/{{ $('Parse payload').item.json.clip_id }}/status",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $vars.MD_N8N_READ_TOKEN }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ status: $json.body?.decision === 'reject' ? 'rejected' : 'review_timeout', stage: $json.body?.stage ?? 'unknown', n8n_execution_id: $execution.id }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 20000
        }
      },
      "id": "c8a00008-0000-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "name": "API-55 mark rejected / timed out",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1980,
        400
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "notes": "Rejected clips are deleted from the ingest bucket by its lifecycle rule; timeouts go back to the queue and count toward R-06 (too few usable clips)."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $vars.MD_CURATOR_TELEGRAM_CHAT }}",
        "text": "=⚠️ Clip {{ $('Parse payload').item.json.clip_id }} stopped at {{ $json.stage ?? 'review' }} ({{ $json.status }}). If usable clips < 12 by Fri 12:00 the Ruko backup trigger applies (grand-council §5).",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "c8a00008-0000-4000-8000-000000000011",
      "name": "Notify: stopped",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        2200,
        400
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ON_IMPORT",
          "name": "Margdarshak curators bot"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "// Parse the signed payload only after the signature check passed.\nconst p = JSON.parse($('Clip ready for review (from Workflows)').item.json.body.payload);\nif (!/^clip_[a-z0-9]{8,40}$/.test(p.clip_id)) throw new Error('bad clip_id');\nreturn { json: { clip_id: p.clip_id, proposed_windows_count: Number(p.proposed_windows_count) || 0, blur_audit_url: p.blur_audit_url } };"
      },
      "id": "c8a00008-0000-4000-8000-000000000012",
      "name": "Parse payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        120
      ]
    }
